  "ppckg": null,
  "pdescr": "Batiste Bare Scent Dry Shampoo delivers the oil-absorbing hair refresh you love in a delicate, subtle scent. The understated blend of mild florals, bright leafy greens, citrus and vanilla doesn\u2019t overwhelm or compete with your favorite perfume. Rice starch takes center stage in our plant-powered aerosol dry shampoo spray. Its natural oil-absorbing, grease-busting properties add volume and texture between washes for hair that looks fresh and clean in just a few spritzes. Great ingredients lead to gorgeous hair, that\u2019s why Batiste is thoughtfully made without sulfates (SLS/SLES), parabens, ammonia, phthalates, formaldehyde, silicones or synthetic colors, and is not tested on animals. Whether you\u2019re running late or running the world, this time-saving dry shampoo spray keeps your blowout going strong. To use, just shake, spray (about 12 inches from your roots), tousle with your fingers, brush it through, and boom\u2014you're out the door. Batiste's got your back, so no matter what the day brings, you can live your best life knowing your hair is ready for anything.",
